  nodes:
  - id: kid_start
    text: Oh hello there! Can you help me to find "Miss Froggy", "Doctor Shepperd",
      "Mister Roach" and "The Junior". Benjamin told me, that they told him they'd
      go for a swim in the sea. But it is dangerous for them out there.
    choices:
    - label: Who are these people?
      nextNodeID: kid_expl
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: They'll come back on their own
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: General Kenobi
      nextNodeID: kid_reference
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: kid_expl
    text: So Miss Froggy is a green supermodel who likes to listen to metal. Doctor
      Shepperd is orange and always messes up the recycling. Mister Roach likes to
      eat cupcakes. Oh and he is blue! The Junior loooooves tulips and poops 7 times
      a day, that's why he is brown.
    choices:
    - label: Alright... I'll look for them
      nextNodeID: kid_thanks
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: They'll come back on their own
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: kid_thanks
    text: Thank youuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuu!!!
    choices:
    - label: Leave
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: You're Welcooooooooome
